2 CONT @R-1099054855@  Ancestry Family Trees  Online publication - Provo, UT, USA: Ancestry.com.  Original data:  Family Tree files submitted by Ancestry members. Släktträd i Ancestry  http://trees.ancestry.com/pt/AMTCitationRedir.aspx?t
2 CONC id=61309473&pid=503
