1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ingeborg, till Häggatorp=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On the question''' of '''Ingeborg, till Häggatorps''' identity, the following reasoning just might make sense. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/H%C3%A5rd_af_Torestorp_nr_60#TAB_1 '''Bengt Hård, till Mollungen'''], ''stamfar'' [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/H%C3%A5rd_af_Torestorp Hård af Torestorp], married '''Christina Uddesdotter'''.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Christina Uddesdotter''' was the daughter of '''Udde Nilsson''' ('''''Nielsen''''') from Denmark whose coat was a "Halvmåne med en stjärna". And '''Ingeborg, till Häggatorp''' was his wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''I decided to search''' Adelsvapen for "till Häggatorp" to see who might have lived here. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/H%C3%A4ggatorp '''Häggatorp'''] is a herrgård in [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laske-Vedums_socken Laske-Vedum] in [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vara_kommun Vara], Västra Götaland County. Which is 
2 CONC not far from Denmark. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lindel%C3%B6f_af_Kedom_nr_129#TAB_2 '''Göstaf Joensson, till Rylanda''' (Lindelöf af Kedom)] had a daughter whose name was Ingeborg. But no other intel on her in Adelsvapen. Judging by the nam
2 CONC e, Göstaf was about to move to Rylanda i [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryda_socken Ryda], which also is in Vara. Less than 20 km from Vedum. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''Fädernegården'' Häggatorp''' was about to go to Göstaf's brother [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lindel%C3%B6f_af_Kedom_nr_129#TAB_3 '''Hans Joensson, till Häggatorp''']. Hans also had a daughter whose name was Ingeborg
2 CONC , but Ingeborg Hansdotter war married to [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Hierta_nr_381#TAB_4 '''Lars Hierta''']. According to Hierta's profile, he was married to "Ingeborg Lindelöf af Kedom" dotter av '''Hans Joensson ''af R
2 CONC ylanda''''' och '''Häggetorps-släkten''' eller '''Lindelöf af Kedom''', 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''So, judging by''' Hierta's profile, it turns out that Hans was from Rylanda, and not from Häggatorp, as proposed by his suffix (till Häggaorp). Be that as it may, in any case, he belonged to the family known as Lindelöf af Kedo
2 CONC m or Häggetorp-ätten. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On the subject''' of "fädernegården", we'll go back to "Joen Svensson, till Kedom" (Kedum) i likan, socken. Only no such socken exists any longer. There are, however, Norra Kedum and [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/S%C3%B6dra_Ke
2 CONC dums_socken Södra Kedum] instead. Of those two Södra Kedum is also located in Vara.   
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Geography matters'''. Now it is proposed that Udde and Ingeborg, till Häggatorps's daughter '''Christina''', who married '''Bengt Hård''', was born in [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gryteryds_socken Gryteryd] in Gislaved. I fai
2 CONC l to see that be supported by any data. But while on the topic of geography, Gislaved is some 150 km south in Småland from Vara. But Herrljunga, where the family Hård's Mollunge is located in just some 25 km away. Could be almost 
2 CONC 50 km, depending on in which part of the [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ods_socken Od] Mollungen is located. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''In conclusion''':
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Seems likely''' that '''Ingerborg, till Häggatorp''' is of the family [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lindel%C3%B6f_af_Kedom_nr_129#TAB_2 '''Lindelöf af Kedum''']. To be more specific, Göstafsdotter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Seems likely''' She and Udde stayed somewhere in Vara. Maybe she even ended up owning Häggatorp. There seems to be some static about the ownership. No evidence points to Småland and Gislaved. Instead, the geographic proximity
2 CONC  to the family Hård makes a lot of sense.  
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Seems likely''', in the absence of any data, that if what is proposed above makes sense, then chances are that Christina Uddesdoter, married to Bengt Hård, did not die in Berga, Ljungby, but in Mollungen. Their son Knut did m
2 CONC ove to Berga, Ljungby. But did the mother follow her there given that Mollungen stayed within the family? Under [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/H%C3%A5rd_af_Torestorp_nr_60#TAB_3 Claes Knutsson, till Mollunge]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Opinions?''' Yays or nays? 
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
