1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.wallbring.se/Hstuart.htm (source provided by A. Saarinen)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ulf Siggesson Soop and Kerstin Karlsdotter Schack married on "1463-10-04" (according to source).  Kerstin could not have died "exactly" in "1464", if "first" of her two children (Knut) was born "exactly" in "1465".  
2 CONT
2 CONT We'll therefore marked Knut Ulfsson Soop having born in "c." 1464, Margareta Ulfsdotter having born in "c." 1465 and Kerstin Karlsdotter Schack (the mother) having died in "c." 1465. 
