1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Arvid Sigvidsson Ribbing=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Sigvid Sigvidsson Ribbing and Märta Ulfsdotter (Ulvåsa) 
2 CONT * Arvid Ribbing , Riksråd 1371, belonged to a Halland Nobility (Nr.15)
2 CONT * According to Johan Peringskiöld, he was alleged to be the son of Sigvid Ribbing and Märta Ulfsdotter (Ulvåsaätten).
2 CONT * Ribbing is a multi-headed Swedish way of judging whose history, according to uncertain sources, is said to go back to the 10th century . On 31 December 2013, 254 people with the surname Ribbing were resident in Sweden. Of these,
2 CONC  half belong to the noble family. The family Ribbing is believed to be a branch of the Porse family , because they belong to the lake leaf setters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arvid_Sigvidsson_Ribbing
2 CONT * https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ribbing_nr_15
2 CONT * https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Mobil/Artikel/6656
2 CONT * https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ribbing_(adels%C3%A4tt)
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Engelsbrekt Engelbrektsson's history , Eric Tuneld, Stockholm 1784
2 CONT * Gillingstam, Hans :  Ribbing (släkt) i Svenskt biografiskt lexikon (1998-2000) - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Mobil/Artikel/6656
2 CONT * Engelsbrekt Engelbrektssons historia, Eric Tuneld, Stockholm 1784 Litteratur [redigera]
2 CONT * Hans Gillingstam, Svenskt biografiskt lexikon, band 30 (1998), s. 97-119.
2 CONT
