1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Grip
2 CONT
2 CONT "Birgitta Nilsdotter, död 1549. Gift 1536 med slottsloven på Stockholms slott Björn Pedersson (Bååt)"
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Birgitta Nilsdotter (yngre Grip)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Riksråd Nils Bosson (yngre Grip) and Anna Arvidsdotter Trolle 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: Björn Pedersson (son of Peder Erlandsson, the elder. Tab. 14), to Fållnäs. National Council of 1547-1560. Death 1570-06-01. Married 1: o 1528 with Brita Nilsdotter, daughter of the Knight, Riksrådet and Östgötalagmannen
2 CONC  Nils Bosson (Grip) and Anna Trolle nr 36. Married 2: o with Christina Krumme, daughter of the knight, the council and the statue holder at Stockholm Castle Nils Nilsson Krumme, to Örboholm and Gesterby, and Margareta Siggesdotter
2 CONC  (Sparre).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Brita Nilsdotter:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gustaf Björnsson. Privy Council. Death 1594. See Tab. 16th
2 CONT * Anna Björnsdotter. Married to fence Arent Joensson (Gyllenhorn).
2 CONT * Magdalena Björnsdotter. Married 1: o 1577 with chambermaid Erik Andersson (Ekeblad). Married 2: o with Torsten Christoffersson (Forstenasläkten).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Ramstad&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=6&postid=sdhk_16541&tab=post SDHK no: 16541]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1405 September 7, Place of issue: Oak tree''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT The knight Nils Bosson cedes to his brother the knight Sten Bosson land in Snetomta in Skerike sn, Norrbo hd, in Västmanland in exchange for land in Ramstad in Bjälbo sn, Göstrings hd, in Östergötland.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000006127284982?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000212904645821 '''Additional text On the reverse side: Snehetompta ok Ramstadha. SEAL'''] N. 1. See N. 514, i; N. 2. Cleft shield with ci
2 CONC rcum.: s. ragvalli magsusson (!); N. 3. See N. 106, 2; N. 4 is missing.
