1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Jakob Björnsson (Bååt) =
2 CONT
2 CONT * Bååt nr 3 Geneology shoes that  Jakob Björnsson (Bååt) is the son of Björn Pedersson (Bååt) and Christina Krumme, but in another source in the book of Abrahamsson, Granfelt, Volume 1, shows he is the son of Björn Pedersson (Bååt
2 CONC ) & Birgitta Nilsdotter (yngre Grip). This must of been a slight mistake in the Bååt nr 3 Geneology.  
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT Jakob Björnsson (son of Björn Pedersson) to Stäflö in Åby parish, Kalmar County. Stallholder at Kalmar Castle 1586. Married to Catharina Stensdotter, daughter of Sten Bengtsson (Backing Wolf) to Stäflö and Kerstin Anundsdotter (Ul
2 CONC fsax).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Jakob Jakobsson (Snakenborg).''' Vice President. Death 1627. 
2 CONT * '''Kerstin Jakobsdotter.''' Married in 1627 with the outright man Olof Svensson, who was Jakob Jakobsson Snakenborg's farmer. In 1603 she had been guilty of cruelty and was therefore excluded from all legacy.
2 CONT
