2 CONT **	(iv)	Sir Robert Gorges of Redlynch (b c1588, d 1648)
2 CONT *** 	(a)	Thomas Gorges of Redlynch 	m. (10.12.1632) Margaret Poyntz (dau of Sir Robert Poyntz of Iron Acton)wife of Thomas, presumed mother of ...
2 CONT **** 	((1))	Poyntz Gorges of Redlynch
2 CONT ***(b)	Charles Gorges 	
