2 CONC Tulloch5, daughter of William Tulloch of Skea6 and probably Barbara Thomasdaughter7. Ursula died before 1587.10 Married 2nd shortly after 1587 Else Tronds, daughter of the Norwegian admiral Christoffer Trondsen and Karen Knutsdaug
2 CONC hter Schanke. After his second marriage he stayed in Norway in periods. The first years he stayed in Gjersvik (Tysnes, Norway), later at Hovland (also in Tysnes). But he always named himself "of Hugoland", even when he stayed in N
2 CONC orway.12
