2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sven Store==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sven Store . Issued Haganäs against Trollåsa in Håcksviks sn / P which he obtained with his wife 1 . His seal shows the Store weapon (the star, however, is unclear). Could possibly be identical to the squire Sven Tordsson that 1
2 CONC 434-06-21 appears as sigillbeseglare 1 (seal off). According to the family books, his widow remarried a Lasse Tordsson whose son Tord Larsson had the daughter Kerstin who was married to Birger Bertilsson Lilliehöök and Jöns Tordss
2 CONC on (Anrep, Tab. 19). 2
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Tord Svensson Store,'''Squire. Tord Svensson Store to Tvärred in the same parish, Älvsborg County. Was gunner 1 1453-01-22, when he acted as a regular at gunner Nanne Kärling's morning gift to his wife Kristina Kristiernsdott
2 CONC er Leijonhufvud . Purchased a farm Västatorp in Floby parish, Skaraborgs county from Greger Kristiernsson Leijonhufvud on 1 1462-05-09, which then calls him "his lovely ability". Only carried one Sparre in the weapon. Married 1: o
2 CONC  with a sister or daughter of Greger Kristiernsson Leijonhufvud . Married 2nd with Kristina Håkansdotter , who lived widow in Tvärred in 1493 and 1496. Daughter ofHåkan Eriksson in Risa.
2 CONT *''' Björn Svensson Store,''' Björn Svensson Store in Torestorp in Svenljunga parish, Älvsborg county. Lived in 1465. Married to Kerstin Johansdotter .
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source'''  Store No. 79 - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Store_nr_79
2 CONT
