2 CONT * Son of Sven Magnusson Store and Kristina Håkansdotter 
2 CONT * Tord Svensson Store to Tvärred in the same parish, Älvsborg County. Was armed 1 1453-01-22, when he acted as a nephew of Nanne Kärling's morning gift to his wife Kristina Kristiernsdotter Leijonhufvud . Bought 1 1462-05-09 a far
2 CONC m Västatorp in the Floby parish, Skaraborg County by Greger Kristiernsson Leijonhufvud, which then calls him his "beloved gem". Bring only one sparre to the gun. Married 1: o with a sister or daughter of Greger Kristiernsson Leijo
2 CONC nhufvud . Married 2: o with Kristina Håkansdotter , who lived widow in the twentieth 1493 and 1496. Daughter of Håkan Eriksson in Risa.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriages==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: (1) '''Kristina Kristiernsdotter Leijonhufvud''', 
2 CONT * Married: (2) '''Kristina Håkansdotter,''' who lived widow in the twentieth 1493 and 1496. Daughter of Håkan Eriksson in Risa.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sven Tordsson Store''' . Kyrkoherde in Yllestad's pastorate by Skara stifter. Lived 1496.
2 CONT * '''Ragnhild Tordsdotter Store''' . Married to Knut Arvidsson .
2 CONT * '''Kerstin Tordsdotter Store''' (and other tasks daughter of Tord Larsson). 2 Married to the gunman Birger Bertilsson Lilliehöök of Gälared and Kolbäck . His 2nd married 1510-11-25 on Kolbäck (morning gift) with Anna Jonsdotter 
2 CONC .
2 CONT * '''Knut Tordsson Store''' . Be warden 1471-02-25, when he was on the shaft when the warden Peder Nilsson on Öresten gave his wife morning gift. 1
2 CONT
