1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Anna Gustafsdotter (äldre Stenbock)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Gustaf Olsson Stenbock, till Toftaholm and Ingrid Bengtsdotter (Vinstorp)
2 CONT * Lived at Toftaholm:
2 CONT * Arvid gave morning gift to Anna 1477-08-25
2 CONT * The above modern designation goes back to the fact that the family, which since the latter half of the 16th century bore the name Stenbock after its coat of arms, has taken up this coat of arms from the present already extinct 1
2 CONC 492 on the man's side, from which it derives from the mother. Originally, the family belonged to the low-farmer in the Småland province of Finnveden. Its oldest known ancestor's son, however, became the council during the rebellio
2 CONC n of the 1430s and father of two councils, one of which was active in Finland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  '''Ficke Gustavsson (Ängaätt),'''  son of Gustav Laurensson (Ängaätt) and Margareta Olofsdotter (Hjulstaätt)
2 CONT * Married: ''' Arvid Knutsson (Sparre över Stjärna),''' son of Knut Arvidsson, till Torpa (Sparre över Stjärna) and Kerstin Bengtsdotter (Kompan)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Arvid Knutsson (Sparre över Stjärna)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Olof Arvidsson (Stenbock),''' Armed Forces and District Chief. Died in 1508. He took up his maternal arms and became the progenitor of the younger Capricorn family. See the wonderful family Capricorn .
2 CONT * '''Bengt Arvidsson, Squire,''' † before 1526, Married uncertain to whom 1489, when he issued a now-lost morning gift letter. Dead childless.
2 CONT * '''Knut Arvidsson,''' Arms, Chief of Staff. Death before 1526 childless. (But married)
2 CONT * '''Gustaf Arvidsson,''' dead childless about 1536.
2 CONT * '''Kerstin Arvidsdotter,''' married to the gunman Claes Hansson ( Uggla ).
2 CONT * '''Estrid Arvidsdotter,''' married before 1508 with the gunman and the commander-in-chief Peder Månsson ( Stierna ).
2 CONT * '''Märta Arvidsdotter,''' lived in 1558. Married before 1508 with the gunman and the district chief in Västbo hired Olof Drake .
2 CONT * '''Ingrid Arvidsdotter,''' lived in 1529. Married to the bailiff in Western and Southern Vedbo hd Nils Bagge ., Lived at Äpplaholm in N. Sandsjö sn (Jönk.), † 1530.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Capricorn, older family==
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Gustavsdotier. Received 1488 Tofta in Dörarps sn, Sunnerbo hd in Småland by the father. Died no later than 27.2 or 24.9 1508. - Received 12.9 1474 the Lidhem farm in Väckelsångs sn, Konga hd in Småland and land in this as wel
2 CONC l as Allbo, Norrvidinge and Sunnerbo hd in the same landscape as morning gift by the knight Ficke Gustavsson ( Ängätten ), which is not later mentioned in life. 25.8 1477 she received the Torpa farm in Länghems sn. Kinds hd in Väs
2 CONC tergötland along with land in this and As hd in the same landscape and in Västbo hd in Småland as a morning gift by the lawman in Tiohärad, later the national council and the governor of Kind Arvid Knutsson ( save over star ), whi
2 CONC ch was joined in Kalmar at least 1474-1481 , at his death, was a chief white man on Öresten in Västergötland and died between 12.3 1497 and 25.3 1498.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source'''  Capricorn, older family - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Stenbock,_%C3%A4ldre_%C3%A4tten
2 CONT
