2 CONT * Granfelt fran Dal - Mörner af Tuna, Volume 2 - https://books.google.com/books?id=lRRNJiY6A5IC&pg=PA196&lpg=PA196&dq=Christina+H%C3%A5kansdotter+Thun&source=bl&ots=jA-IFeOi3W&sig=ACfU3U0BrjtUQJkd7qxYzyOWx9jqJ0AuTQ&hl=en&sa=X&ved=
2 CONC 2ahUKEwiF2-ne2NbvAhWWIDQIHUL4Dz4Q6AEwEXoECAwQAg#v=onepage&q=Christina%20H%C3%A5kansdotter%20Thun&f=false
