2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Lossaätten / The Lossa family===
2 CONT The family died out before the Swedish House of Knights was founded in 1625, so it was never introduced as a noble family. Earlier theories that the Soop family descended from the Lossa family have been rejected. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ref: https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lossa%C3%A4tten
