2 CONT * Sources: Post-medieval regest/notice:  Kålland district court AIa:14 (1697-1700) (under 26 January 1698), GLA, Literature and commentary For Humfrid and son Byting, see SoH 1958, p. 10, and cf. SDHK no. 30430 , which letter this
