2 CONT '''Byting Olofsson sells with his mother Humfrid Jonsdotter's consent land in Hög (Sunnersbergs sn, Kållands hd).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Post-medieval regest/notice:  Kålland district court AIa:14 (1697-1700) (under 26 January 1698), GLA, Literature and commentary For Humfrid and son Byting, see SoH 1958, p. 10, and cf. SDHK no. 30430 , which lette
2 CONC r this (partially) supplemented/corrected dating is based on.
2 CONT
