2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Stola&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=10&postid=sdhk_30430&tab=post SDHK-nr: 30430]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters'''
