2 CONT * '''Date: 1478 July 25, Place of issue: Stole'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Humfridh" Jonsdotter, Byting's widow in "Stordhom" (Stola i Strö sn, Kållands hd, Västergötland), with the consent of her son Byting, gives a part in a meadow at Aspenäs ödetorp to Otterstad's rectory. The issuer seals together wi
2 CONC th Sten, parish priest in Sunnersberg. 
2 CONT
