1 DEAT
2 DATE 1672
2 ADDR
3 CITY Funbo
3 STAE Uppland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Kyrkoherde Funbo (C) 1644-1672, Pastor
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johan Persson Stille, skrevs 1625 in vid Uppsala universitet och blev senare kontraktsprost i Funbo och prästmötets ordförande 1657. Han utmärkte sig för att inte se ut som en präst varken i fråga om klädsel eller 
2 CONC frisyr. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Rev. Johann Stille (say 1604-1672). House chaplain to Count Gabriel Bengtsson Oxenstierna, also Pastor of Fundbo, 1644-1672. Member of the Riksdag, 1649.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Master Johan Stillerus of Roslagen.  House chaplain to the Royal Treasurer Axel Oxentiserna. Pastor here (Fundbo), 1644. The Council greatly interfered with his appointment in 1643 because he had been a pastor only a short time, 
2 CONC had no experience of suffering, and was like no other priest either in his mode of dress or in his hair style, and possessed no special eloquence. First Master, 1646. Member of the Riksdag (Parliament), 1649. Speaker of the minist
2 CONC erial assembly, 1657. Died 1672. Married the daughter of his predecessor of (Azarias Johannis Upsaliensis." 
