2 CONT * '''Beata Gyllensvärd owns Bågen and Ösa in Laxarby and Sunsnäs in Steneby and Agneta Swedish own the Vageln in Ödskölt. ''' They want views between their salvation and Bratterud in Laxarby, which Halvard Gunnarsson and Buste Nor
2 CONC däling own, Skåpenäs, Laxarby which Olof Andersson owns, and Kroken i Ödskölt, which Jon Nilsson and Stenar Bryngelsson own - https://www.abc.se/~m225/litteratur/kallmat/Vedbodombok.html
2 CONT
