1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birgitta Stensdotter (Bielke)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Sten Turesson, till Örby (Bielke) and Margareta Karlsdotter (Sparre av Tofta) 
2 CONT * Birgitta Stensdotter (Bielke) , died around 1462 . Daughter of Sten Turesson (Bielke) and Margareta Karlsdotter (Sparre of Tofta) . Sister of King Karl Knutsson (Bonde) , mother of the governor Sten Sture the elder , and grandmo
2 CONC ther's mother to King Gustav Vasa .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriages==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married 1) with '''Gustav Anundsson Sture'''
2 CONT * Married 2) with the Knight and the Council of Norway '''Gustav Karlsson (gum head)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Birgitta Stensdotter to Ekholmen after brother Knut Stensson's death 1451 (Bbl.) Lived 1461-01-02 but was dead (Bbl.) 1464-06-04. '''Married 1st before 1438-08-29 with the knight, the national council and the governor of Kalmar ca
2 CONC stle Gustaf Anundsson Sture,''' dead 1444 (Pt XXI p. 103), and in this married mother of the governor Sten Sture d. o before 1446-12-02 with the knight, the national council and the lawman of Uppland '''Gustaf Karlsson (gum head)'
2 CONC '' to Ekholmen, in his 2nd marriage [married 1st with Märta Karlsdotter. Married 3: o 1474 to Ingeborg Filipsdotter, daughter of Filip Axelsson (Tott)], Deceased 1486-07-26. - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bielke_af_%C3%85k
2 CONC er%C3%B6_nr_8#TAB_13
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Birgitta Gustavsdotter (Sture),''' dead in cot 1472
2 CONT * '''Sten Sture the elder,''' Sveriges riksförståndare 1470-1497 and 1501-1503
2 CONT
2 CONT == Swedish Diplomatarium's National Archives of Medieval Letters
2 CONT
