1 NOTE {geni:about_me} James Hepburn, 1st Duke of Orkney (c. 1534 – 14 April 1578), better known by his inherited title as 4th Earl of Bothwell, was hereditary Lord High Admiral of Scotland. He is best known for his association with and 
2 CONC subsequent marriage to Mary, Queen of Scots, as her third husband.
