1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Lennart Larsson Silfverswärd=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Lars Larsson Silfverswärd, dy and Brita Lennartsdotter Svenske
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000007632901562&photo_id=6000000085090079897&position=0 '''Eskilsäter Church, Värmland. Funeral Banner and Family Board for Lennart Silfversvärd''']
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Silfversw%C3%A4rd_nr_184#TAB_5 Noble family Silfverswärd no. 184. Ennobled 1630-10-20, Introd. 1633. The family has a common origin with the noble families Svärdf.]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 5'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Lennart , (son of Lars dy, table 4), to Säter norrgården in Eskilsäters parish, Värmland county. Born 1636. Ensign at M. Married De la Gardie's dragoon regiment 1657. Lieutenant there. 1659. Captain-lieutenant 1661. Dismissal when
2 CONC  the regiment was reduced on 27/8. Captain at CJ De la Chapelle's squadron of Scanian nobility's trappers 1666-10-11. Captain at the Skåne and Bohusland dragoon regiment 1670-05-14. Lieutenant colonel in the marine regiment (GA Br
2 CONC akel's regiment) in 1676. Died on 23/5 in Stockholm and buried under the sacristy in Eskilsäter's church, where his main banners are still found. '''Married 1st 1662-11-21 to Magdalena Dücker , born 1645-09-17 Tidaholm, died 1664-
2 CONC 09-21, daughter of Corporal Gustaf Dücker (Dykert), no. 207, and Anna Kafle. Married 2nd to Estrid Uggla in her 1st marriage (married 2nd to lieutenant Bo Roos af Hjelmsäter , died before 1681), born 1630, died 1701-12-28 Gårstad.
2 CONC '''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  1st 1662-11-21 to '''Magdalena Dücker''' born 1645-09-17 Tidaholm, died 1664-09-21, daughter of Corporal Gustaf Dücker (Dykert), no. 207, and Anna Kafle. 
2 CONT * Married: 2nd to '''Estrid Uggla in her 1st marriage''' (married 2nd to lieutenant Bo Roos af Hjelmsäter , died before 1681), born 1630, died 1701-12-28 Gårstad.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Johan''' , born 1664-09-13, died sd
