1 CONT other families.
1 CONT 2- The birth place name "Espas" is not in the postal book. There is an
1 CONT "Espnas" village in Brunflo parish, Jamtland county, Sweden. Ther is not a
1 CONT farm or village by the name of "Espas" listed in Jonkoping parish or county.
