1 CONC ince of Maine, 3 vols. (1890) [incl. works by Gorges] · C. M. Andrews, The colonial period of American history, 1 (1937) · E. T. Shields, ?Gorges, Ferdinando?, ANB · S. S. Webb, The governors-general: the English army and the defi
1 CONC nition of the empire, 1569?1681 (1979), 16?21 · R. W. Judd, E. A. Churchill, and J. W. Eastman, eds., Maine: the pine tree state from prehistory to the present (1995), 52?60 · DNB
